# The Village Bridge (a village strung along a bridge, with a musician at every corner): a wistful accordion tune in A minor over
# a plucked guitar, a soft pad, an upright bass and a brushed beat. At night a clarinet takes the tune, slower. Original composition
# for this game (plan 22 · U8, part a).
